# EmailJS — sends the RSVP email directly from the browser (no backend).
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com
# 2. Add an Email Service (connect your Gmail) and create an Email Template
#    using variables: {{from_name}}, {{attendance}}, {{wishes}}, {{created_at}}
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your values from
#    EmailJS Dashboard -> Account -> API Keys (public key),
#    Email Services (service ID), Email Templates (template ID).
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
